WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,020
It's so cold, why don't you let them in?

2
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:16,980
Everyone heard that you are coming

3
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:17,980
No matter how cold the weather is, we still have to come out to welcome you.

4
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,980
I feel sad when I see it

5
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,980
Is it because I feel distressed or do I want to be miserable?

6
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:22,980
Just these footprints all over the yard

7
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:23,980
Anyone with eyes can see it

8
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,980
They waited outside for an hour or two

9
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:26,980
You really feel bad

10
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,980
Why don't you build a fire for people to keep warm?

11
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,040
I put this on purpose

12
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,040
Isn’t it just to make Captain Lu feel distressed after seeing it?

13
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,040
Give you more supplies

14
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:37,140
I have never seen such direct dismantling.

15
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,140
The person who slaps him in the face with every word

16
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:41,140
Miss Han, this is the condition I have here.

17
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,140
If you say I'm miserable, I can't refute you.

18
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,140
Did you hear that?

19
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,140
This is totally ruined

20
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,140
Put the question directly
